Bind Npc 24422 Zone 11

On greeting
    If quest 317 is started and player has 910132000
        Say "I am Jerain, the sixth [Poet of Suffering]! You have the [Fifth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "There are two different exploration territories in the Adonis continent. Of the two, what is the name of the region used by novice knights which high-level knights above Level 60 are prohibited from entering?"
            Topic "Arrdream" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910132000
                    Give 1 of 910133000
            Topic "Ronark Land" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910132000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Fifth Certificate of Suffering] has been consumed as penalty. It is time for me to leave now."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 317 is started
        Say "I am Jerain, the sixth [Poet of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fifth Certificate of Suffering]."
    Else
        Say ""
